{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mr. Green receives a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> raise every year.  His salary after four such raises has gone up by what percent?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/9/769d7b59602692648661862a5e8b5611c522cea7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{less than }40\\% \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 40\\% \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 44\\% \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 45\\% \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{more than }45\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"601\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each year, Mr. Green's salary is multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/8/dd8947103eef4bf1bdd05314762d33e9913e6840.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />.  Therefore, after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years, his salary will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/4/544bc89098a34d4a69426095036d9110c054b2be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.1^4 = 1.4641$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"17\" /> times his current salary, for a total increase of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/6/456839aeb523a49d2fde1b3036aedacfb7c91b38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$46.41\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee5536bf4bd4ed787c4ec4cbb8da26db6f42c354.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{more than }45\\% }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"160\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose Mr. Green's salary is originally <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a9659adf2f3dbf4f9619d4fdc9f95f1abe3dfa51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />. After <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> year, his salary will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/0/b80e9004a3f6ccc4b5a2b2c961cb7b212d1f4b6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$110.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />. After <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years, his salary will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/7/0373bf73cadda92682477480195a9932f4bba7da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$121.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />.  After <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years, his salary will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/f/a3f2cf4438bf81ac2e8996eb70f5d7ab18546ac0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$133.10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />.  After <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years, his salary will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/c/68c8537e92383e66308aeb925a9621bd1e872930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$146.41$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/63864440cf9b231d710d507c4148010b1c0726c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.4641$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> times his original salary.  This is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/6/456839aeb523a49d2fde1b3036aedacfb7c91b38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$46.41\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" /> increase, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/3684300f35059af22817de82ea5c38981e5320ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{more than 45\\%}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"157\" height=\"30\" />. \n</p><p>~sakshamsethi\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\"